  "details": "I would like to temporarily hide friends that are either in private worlds, \"Ask Me\", or \"Do Not Disturb\" statuses, without unfriending anyone. Of course, you should also be able to set individual exceptions to that filter, as some friends do allow me to join after I request an invite off them most of the time. People on Favorite groups should also be exempt from the filter by default.\nIt should still display all the hidden friends in a separate category, as to not exclude them completely.",
